        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f5f7fa;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding:40px 0;\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08);\">\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#2563eb;padding:25px;text-align:center;\">\n<h2 style=\"color:#ffffff;margin:0;\">Meeting Confirmed</h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:35px;color:#333;\">\n\n<p>Hi <strong>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json.fullName }}</strong>,</p>\n\n<p>Your meeting has been successfully scheduled.</p>\n\n<table cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"35%\"><strong>Meeting</strong></td>\n<td>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json.meetingTitle }}</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Date</strong></td>\n<td>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json.preferredDate }}</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Time</strong></td>\n<td>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json.preferredTime }}</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Duration</strong></td>\n<td>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json.durationMinutes }} Minutes</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Purpose</strong></td>\n<td>{{ $('Code in JavaScript').item.json.meetingPurpose }}</td>\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px;\">\nPlease join the meeting on time. If you need to reschedule, kindly contact us in advance.\n</p>\n\n<p>We look forward to speaking with you.</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\nBest Regards,<br>\n<strong>AI Meeting Scheduler</strong>\n</p>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
